{"version":1,"content":"\n<p>Lockoon 是一款為有期限的專注季節而設的習慣追蹤工具，並非要求你無止境地堅持下去。你可以自訂要做的事、維持多少天，以及何謂完成，然後每天逐項打勾，看著毛毛蟲經歷五個階段：毛毛蟲、吐絲、結繭、破繭、成蝶。程式原價 US $0.99，現時<a href=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/category/apps-%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/%E9%99%90%E6%99%82%E5%85%8D%E8%B2%BB%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">限時免費</a>，適合想在短期內集中完成目標、又不想被永無止境的習慣清單壓住的讀者。</p>\n<figure><img alt=\"限時免費\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"460\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/460x460Icon-Ap-SiOS01-75-127.webp\" width=\"460\"/></figure>\n<h2>自訂達標門檻與休息日</h2>\n<p>開季前先決定要做什麼、為期多少天，以及哪些日子才算在時間表內；未排定的日子不會反過來扣分，休息日在方格中亦顯示為休息。達標門檻由你設定，預設為排定步驟的 80%，一個狀態不佳的星期不會拖垮整季。主畫面小工具備有三種尺寸，可直接勾選當日目標，完成後改為顯示連續日數。</p>\n<figure>\n<figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1242x2688bb-581-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure>\n<figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1242x2688bb-582-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure>\n<figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1242x2688bb-583-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure>\n<figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1242x2688bb-584-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure>\n<figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1242x2688bb-585-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure>\n<figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1242x2688bb-586-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure>\n</figure>\n<ul>\n<li>應用名稱：Lockoon</li>\n<li>應用類別：Productivity</li>\n<li>下載位置：<a href=\"https://apps.apple.com/app/lockoon/id6814609716?uo=4\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">App Store</a></li>\n</ul>\n","scraped_at":"2026-10-28T18:00:42.307739+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":351,"images":7,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-28T15:46:28+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-29T14:39:57.530281+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-28T17:58:37.141657+00:00","content_hash":"9e22de1d17f639f412f19daf1a8b3975a6fbe391e5945cb1270de31396f28fb7","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}